Package: nvidia-legacy-340xx-driver
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 nvidia-legacy-340xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-340xx-driver-bin (= ${binary:Version}),
 xserver-xorg-video-nvidia-legacy-340xx (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-340xx-kernel-support (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-340xx-kernel-${kernel:Flavour} | nvidia-legacy-340xx-kernel-dkms,
Recommends: libgl1-nvidia-legacy-340xx-glx
Conflicts: nvidia-driver, nvidia-legacy-340xx-driver, nvidia-legacy-470xx-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 340.108 driver metapackage (GeForce 8/9/200/300 series (G8x, G9x, GT2xx))
 The 340.108 driver from the NVIDIA 340xx legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for noble.
 .
 Supported hardware: GeForce 8/9/200/300 series (G8x, G9x, GT2xx).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Upstream EOL 2019-12. Known unfixable security issues — ship with a loud warning.
 .
 SECURITY WARNING: this driver series receives NO security updates from NVIDIA
 and has publicly known, unpatched vulnerabilities. Install it only on isolated
 or offline systems, or where the hardware leaves no supported alternative.
 debconf shows this warning again at install time.
 .
 This package is BEST-EFFORT for ubuntu2404: the shipped X server ABI
 (25) is newer than what this driver officially supports
 (24). IgnoreABI is enabled automatically. Test before relying on it.

Package: nvidia-legacy-340xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-340xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 340.108 driver — core runtime libraries
 Shared libraries used by the NVIDIA 340.108 driver: libnvidia-glcore,
 libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore and friends. Install the :i386 variant
 alongside for 32-bit OpenGL applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-340xx-driver-bin
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 340.108 driver — utilities
 nvidia-smi, nvidia-settings' backend, nvidia-xconfig, nvidia-debugdump and
 the nvidia-persistenced daemon for the 340.108 driver.

Package: libgl1-nvidia-legacy-340xx-glx
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, nvidia-legacy-340xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version})
Provides: libgl1-nvidia-glx
Description: NVIDIA legacy 340.108 driver — libGL / GLX
 The NVIDIA implementation of libGL and the GLX extension for the 340.108
 driver, wired through glvnd where the distro provides it.

Package: xserver-xorg-video-nvidia-legacy-340xx
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends},
 libgl1-nvidia-legacy-340xx-glx (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-340xx-kernel-support (= ${binary:Version}),
Provides: xorg-driver-video
Description: NVIDIA legacy 340.108 driver — Xorg driver
 The nvidia_drv.so X.Org video driver from the 340.108 release.
 Officially targets X server video driver ABI <= 24.

Package: nvidia-legacy-340xx-vdpau-driver
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: vdpau-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 340.108 driver — VDPAU backend
 libvdpau_nvidia.so, the VDPAU hardware video acceleration backend.

Package: nvidia-legacy-340xx-kernel-support
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-340xx-kernel-support-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 340.108 driver — kernel/X integration glue
 Ships the nouveau blacklist, the modprobe alias, the initramfs hook, the udev
 rules and the /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d snippet for the 340.108 driver.
 The snippet sets Option "IgnoreABI" "1" because ubuntu2404 ships a newer X ABI.

Package: nvidia-legacy-340xx-kernel-6.8.0-45-generic
Architecture: amd64
Section: non-free/kernel
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, linux-image-6.8.0-45-generic
Provides: nvidia-legacy-340xx-kernel-6.8.0-45-generic,
 nvidia-legacy-340xx-kernel-modules
Description: NVIDIA legacy 340xx prebuilt module for Linux 6.8.0-45-generic
 The nvidia/-modeset/-drm/-uvm modules from the 340xx series,
 compiled for the 6.8.0-45-generic kernel ABI. No toolchain needed on the target.
